{"id":"115511662605004445","created_at":"2025-11-08T02:14:53.948Z","in_reply_to_id":null,"quote_id":null,"in_reply_to_account_id":null,"sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"en","uri":"https://truthsocial.com/@Rightwingmadman/115511662605004445","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@Rightwingmadman/115511662605004445","content":"<p>Why aren’t senate “Republicans” forcing filibustering Democrats to maintain a round-the-clock, on-their-feet continious talkathon on the senate floor? Because senate Republicans are losers at heart. Weak, pathetic. They have no fight in them. Democrats smash them in the mouth, “Republicans” run away like scared little girls. The Dems’ filibuster strategy would have been scrapped in days had Thune and the rest of these pathetic RINOs forced the aging, barely literate or cognizant nursing home patients like Bernie Sanders to hold the floor or face cloture.</p><p>Were Trump the senate Majority Leader instead of Thune, he would’ve HELD THE SENATE FLOOR WITHOUT EVER RELINQUISHING CONTROL. DEMOCRATS WOULD NEVER RETAKE THE FLOOR. Why? Because Trump’s a fighter. He lives for battle. It’s why the “Republican” party despises him, and regretted that he turned his head that day.</p>","account":{"id":"107834323082119575","username":"Rightwingmadman","acct":"Rightwingmadman","display_name":"Rightwingmadman","locked":false,"bot":false,"discoverable":true,"group":false,"created_at":"2022-02-21T05:26:29.649Z","note":"<p><a href=\"https://truthsocial.com/tags/MAGA\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MAGA</span></a>, baby! Trump doesn’t have a party. First independent President in modern times. Trump doesn’t owe either major party a damn thing.</p>","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@Rightwingmadman","avatar":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accounts/avatars/107/834/323/082/119/575/original/4c6c89af664f021e.jpeg","avatar_static":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accoun